{"text": "Scrooge was a rich old man, but he loved only money. His poor clerk, Bob, was always cold. On Christmas Eve, the ghost of his old friend Marley appeared, covered in heavy chains. The first spirit showed Scrooge a happy Christmas party from his past. The second spirit showed him a table full of food and people who were happy to share. The third spirit, silent and dark, showed him a lonely future. On Christmas morning, Scrooge woke up a new man. He laughed and wished everyone a merry Christmas!", "words": [[0.4, 0.85], [0.85, 1.05], [1.05, 1.18], [1.18, 1.53], [1.53, 1.83], [1.83, 2.45], [2.55, 2.69], [2.69, 2.84], [2.84, 3.31], [3.31, 3.62], [3.62, 4.38], [4.5, 4.71], [4.71, 5.01], [5.01, 5.52], [5.61, 6.02], [6.1, 6.3], [6.3, 6.75], [6.75, 7.43], [8.76, 8.94], [8.94, 9.52], [9.52, 10.21], [10.33, 10.48], [10.48, 10.92], [10.92, 10.99], [10.99, 11.15], [11.15, 11.44], [11.44, 11.82], [11.82, 12.26], [12.26, 13.05], [13.19, 13.64], [13.64, 13.8], [13.8, 14.15], [14.15, 14.99], [16.32, 16.43], [16.43, 16.79], [16.79, 17.54], [17.54, 17.94], [17.94, 18.6], [18.6, 18.73], [18.73, 19.15], [19.15, 19.68], [19.68, 20.19], [20.19, 20.35], [20.35, 20.53], [20.53, 21.21], [22.54, 22.66], [22.66, 23.06], [23.06, 23.69], [23.69, 24.0], [24.0, 24.18], [24.18, 24.31], [24.31, 24.84], [24.84, 25.07], [25.07, 25.25], [25.25, 26.17], [26.17, 26.36], [26.36, 26.73], [26.73, 26.87], [26.87, 26.98], [26.98, 27.36], [27.36, 27.51], [27.51, 28.11], [29.44, 29.59], [29.59, 29.96], [29.96, 30.59], [30.74, 31.26], [31.26, 31.42], [31.42, 32.08], [32.24, 32.52], [32.52, 32.71], [32.71, 32.81], [32.81, 33.31], [33.31, 34.02], [35.35, 35.52], [35.52, 36.04], [36.04, 36.72], [36.87, 37.4], [37.4, 37.61], [37.61, 37.76], [37.76, 37.85], [37.85, 38.05], [38.05, 38.82], [38.95, 39.09], [39.09, 39.68], [39.68, 39.82], [39.82, 40.19], [40.19, 40.74], [40.74, 40.85], [40.85, 41.18], [41.18, 41.98]], "scenes": [0.0, 8.38, 15.94, 22.16, 29.06, 34.97], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george"}